    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1997590926580199432",
      "url": "https://x.com/dost_pagasa/status/1997590926580199432",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/dost_pagasa/status/1997590926580199432",
      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 5 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Shear Line\nIssued at: 5:00 PM, 07 December 2025(Sunday)\n\nORANGE WARNING LEVEL: Quezon(Jomalig, General Nakar, Infanta, Polillo, Burdeos, Panukulan, Patnanungan, Real, Mauban, Sampaloc, Perez, Alabat, Quezon, Calauag, Guinayangan, Tagkawayan, Lopez, Buenavista, Catanauan, Mulanay, San Narciso, San Andres, San Francisco, General Luna, Macalelon, Gumaca, Pitogo, Atimonan, Plaridel, Unisan, Agdangan, Padre Burgos).\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING is still THREATENING.\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Laguna, Quezon(Tayabas, Lucban, Lucena, Pagbilao, Dolores, Candelaria, Sariaya, Tiaong, San Antonio), Rizal(Tanay, Pililla, Jala-Jala) and Batangas(San Juan, Padre Garcia, Rosario, Taysan, Lobo, Santo Tomas, Lipa, San Jose, Ibaan, Batangas City, Balete, Malvar, Tanauan, Mataasnakahoy, Cuenca, San Pascual, Alitagtag).\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nMeanwhile, expect light to moderate with occasional heavy rains over Cavite, Bulacan, Bataan and Pampanga within the next 3 hours.\nLight to moderate with occasional heavy rains affecting Rizal(Rodriguez, Antipolo, Baras, San Mateo, Angono, Binangonan, Cainta, Cardona, Morong, Taytay, Teresa), Metro Manila(Marikina, San Juan, Mandaluyong, Quezon City, Pasig, Muntinlupa, Taguig, Makati, Pateros) and Batangas(Mabini, Bauan, Tingloy, San Luis, Santa Teresita, Taal, San Nicolas, Agoncillo, Lemery, Lian, Tuy, Balayan, Calaca, Calatagan) which may persist within 3 hours and may affect nearby areas.\n\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 8:00 PM today.\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZJq1n.",
